{{!-- components/cta.hbs — the closing ask.

     The design system's `.ns-cta` inside a `.ns-band--dark --grid`: the band
     supplies the navy ground and the hairline grid, the CTA supplies the
     anatomy (title, actions, the fine print under them). The theme's version
     was a hand-built rounded box with its own grid overlay and a decorative
     cloud — three things the band already does, drawn a fourth way.

     ONE CTA PER PAGE, at the end. That is the component's rule and it is why
     this is a partial rather than something a template assembles: two closing
     asks on one page is two things competing for the last click. --}}
<section class="ns-band ns-band--dark ns-band--grid ns-defer ns-defer--sm">
  <div class="ns-band__inner">
    <div class="ns-cta">
      <h2 class="ns-band__title">{{#if title}}{{title}}{{else}}{{t "Join the Ohana"}}{{/if}}</h2>
      <p class="ns-band__lede">{{#if body}}{{body}}{{else}}{{t "New Salesforce tutorials, courses and tips — straight to your inbox. Free, no spam."}}{{/if}}</p>
      <div class="ns-cta__actions">
        {{> "members/subscribe" tone="dark" icon="mail"}}
      </div>
      <span class="ns-cta__fine">{{t "Free. No card. Unsubscribe in one click."}}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
